@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
title POST /api/workspace/v1/messenger/streams/[stream_uuid]/actions/add_users/invoke
actor "Клиент" as Client
participant "WorkspaceStreamBindingController\nRestAlchemy" as API
database "PostgreSQL\nканонические строки + привязки" as DB
queue "Transactional outbox\n+ вывод типизированных задач" as Outbox
participant "Фоновые исполнители\nexact scope leases + fencing" as Worker
database "Готовые проекции\nпривязки контейнеров" as Projection
database "Хранилище публичных событий" as Events
participant "Диспетчер WebSocket" as Dispatcher
actor "Клиент WebSocket" as WS
Client -> API: POST /api/workspace/v1/messenger/streams/{stream_uuid}/actions/add_users/invoke
API -> DB: create/reactivate persistent USER_STREAM_BINDING\nactive=true; membership_generation++
API -> DB: immutable outbox event на каждую typed task
DB --> API: фиксация транзакции
API --> Client: успешный публичный ответ
DB ->> Outbox: зафиксированное событие
Outbox ->> Worker: topic_membership_policy_rebuild / fanout /\nread_counters / folder_projection\nкаждая task имеет своё outbox_event_uuid + expected generation
Worker -> Worker: topic scope: catch-up MESSAGE.created_at DESC;\nshared aggregates: user-stream/user-folder
Worker -> DB: conditional active + generation equality
Worker -> Projection: fresh binding + placement state;\nготовые shared projections
Worker -> Events: события потока/привязки/папки\nатомарно в одной DB transaction с проекцией
Events ->> Dispatcher: зафиксированная готовая строка
Dispatcher ->> WS: отправка / повтор / воспроизведение
note over API,Worker
  Grant active немедленно; историческая видимость eventual.
  Старые binding/state прежнего generation не оживают.
  Lease expiry/fencing, retry/backoff, DLQ/reaper обязательны.
end note
@enduml
